<title>USA: NBC NAMES LOVINGER SALES CHIEF.</title>
<headline>NBC NAMES LOVINGER SALES CHIEF.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>NBC Inc said it named Daniel Lovinger as vice president, international sales, effective August 20.</p>
<p>Lovinger, who was vice president of international business development at Turner Broadcasting Systems, will oversee NBC's U.S.-based international ad sales group.</p>
<p>NBC is a unit of General Electric Co. Turner is a unit of Time Warner Inc.</p>
